    <title>27. 过年啦！你家吃什么馅的饺子？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a2f7f3de29766da9e94169</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a2f7f3de29766da9e94169</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Feb 2026 14:17:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！欢迎收听第27期的default！这期是春节篇的第二期！</span></p><p><span>这期原电池和我聊了聊作为在北京出生长大的孩子在北京过年的回忆。</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾介绍</span></strong><span>：原电池，四月的小学初中高中同学。她也参与录制了第04，05，08，09，21，22，23期的录制。</span></p><p><strong><span>email: </span></strong><span>default0325@hotmail.com</span></p><p><span>更多关于四月：小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/56RZ6Xap3Y" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/56RZ6Xap3Y"><span>@刘四月</span></a></p><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>春节序曲</span></p></li><li><p><span>恭喜发财 by 刘德华</span></p></li><li><p><span>步步高</span></p></li><li><p><span>春节童谣：网络资源</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>策划</span></strong><span>： 刘四月</span></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：刘四月</span></p><p><strong><span>时间点：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong></p><p><span>INTRO+花絮</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a></span></strong></p><p><span>在美国咱们怎么过节？</span></p><p><span>圣诞树变发财树！</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a></span></strong></p><p><span>在北京，过春节家里平时吃什么？</span></p><p><span>耦盒，排叉，pizza dough爆改炸油条。</span></p><p><span>贴窗花，挂灯笼，穿新衣。</span></p><p><span>有关于压岁钱和上门带的礼物的流通问题。</span></p><p><span>座机时代的新年问候。</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a></span></strong></p><p><span>中国人中国胃。</span></p><p><span>半个月前开始计划过年采购。</span></p><p><span>过年前的大扫除和年货。</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a></span></strong></p><p><span>饭桌上的菜各个带有使命：年年有余，金榜题名。</span></p><p><span>你家饺子吃什么馅？</span></p><p><span>有关于压岁钱的交易。</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> </span></strong><span>OUTRO</span></p>]]></description>
