  <item>
    <title>26. 新年快乐，旧年也不赖</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699226fcde29766da9b289cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699226fcde29766da9b289cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 20:09:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！欢迎收听第26期的default！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期聊年终总结，聊新年展望，聊生活不易但心平气和！ 哈哈哈，祝大家马年吉祥，马到成功！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾介绍</span></strong><span>：Dr. Song。他也参与录制了第2，3还有12期的录制。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>email: </span></strong><span>default0325@hotmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多关于四月：小红书</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/56RZ6Xap3Y" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/56RZ6Xap3Y"><span>@刘四月</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>人间烟火 by 夏日入侵企画</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Extraordinary by Connor Price</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>策划</span></strong><span>： 刘四月</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：刘四月</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间点：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>INTRO+花絮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a></span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>四月工作几年重回学校读博一段时间后的体会？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“活着本身就是希望”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>周围的人从同事变成同学有什么体会？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大环境不太理想的情况下，为什么决定从学校到工业界？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>美国科研震荡的一年，都发生了什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dr. Song: 工作机会是经由自己的研究的新闻找上门的。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dr. Song 都做过什么？3D生物打印，用人体温发电的可穿戴设备。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>现在的创业公司还在融资中。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从美东搬到美西感觉如何？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2025年从开始找工作到找到工作要多久？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>回国教职也不那么容易。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2023年是最累的一年。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>除了工作以外，还有什么其他事情可以在2025年写上一笔的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>四月聊聊接触创业的经历？全职学生在美国学校创业？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dr. Song：创业的职位和性格也相关。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>美国学生是怎么想创业的？创业可大可小。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2025年初会做新年计划吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>四月：J人变P中？计划一个都完不成的话太挫败。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dr.Song：严格的J人。计划在滚动进行！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>无论做什么，还是要充分发挥自己的优势。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>面对迷茫要怎么发挥主动积极性不断探索？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2025年，很多相处很久的朋友回国或者搬离身边。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>四月：哭了。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>更怀念从前还是期待以后？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有关于包袱？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>四月：没出国的话现在的我肯定过着非常不一样的生活。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3009">50:09</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>生命在于运动， 运动就是快乐。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Dr. Song: 不要爬野山。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3187">53:07</a></span></strong><span>2026年有什么期许和展望？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> OUTRO</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65d8177fb6c9256aee2a6b43/lt3T0PX9BXssUG_KwBqjwhX3xWq0.m4a" length="35074008" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJU1QF-o_SDbbBmz1smrUIH9CJL.png"/>
