    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！欢迎来听第十九期！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾介绍： James毕业于清华大学，在耶鲁拿到PhD学位后目前在耶鲁做博士后。他的研究方向是神经科学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>email: default0325@hotmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间点：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span></strong><span>Intro+highlights</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>提高记忆力的小tips？</span></p><span></span><p><span>进入心流的三个条件？</span></p><span></span><p><span>duolingo和《黑神话》的共同点？</span></p><span></span><p><span>死生面前无大事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>让事情发生，去经历，佛陀也是先当王子享受过后才来关心众生的啊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以复盘，但是后悔真的没必要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>COVID带来的科研低谷？多亏了老板情绪稳定！</span></p><span></span><p><span>James：担心COVID让人变笨。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>低温慢煮的料理方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>意志力还是别浪费在吃难吃的东西上了吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃饭别吃太饱，细胞慢些分裂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>James的几个创业idea。</span></p><span></span><p><span>生命科学缺乏业界的东西去反哺学界的成果。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“饥饿的果蝇在伴侣和食物中会先去选择食物。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃素还有这作用？</span></p><span></span><p><span>叔本华说了，人生就是钟摆在痛苦和无聊中摇摆。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Questions by Sinco</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Intelligency by August (MBNN Remix)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑，策划</span></strong><span>：刘四月</span></p>]]></description>
